---
import { ArrowUpRight } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section class="py-14 sm:py-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-14">
    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-brand-gold font-medium">
      Colecciones Selectas
    </span>
    <h2 class="font-editorial text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide mt-1.5">
      Curaduría Olfativa de Autor
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-2.5">
      Explora nuestras colecciones exclusivas de perfumería oriental, decants fraccionados y estuches de descubrimiento.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Bento Grid - 3 Active Curated Categories -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
    <!-- Card 1: Perfumes Árabes (Spans 2 columns) -->
    <a
      href="/catalogo?categoria=arabe"
      class="group relative md:col-span-2 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-brand-surface border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-gold/30 p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[260px] sm:min-h-[360px] transition-all duration-300 shadow-luxury"
    >
      <!-- Background Image with Dark Gradient -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594035910387-fea47794261f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80"
          alt="Perfumería Árabe"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-30 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-dark via-brand-dark/70 to-transparent" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold font-medium">
          Dubai & Oriente
        </span>
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/5 group-hover:bg-brand-gold group-hover:text-brand-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-200">
          <ArrowUpRight class="w-4 h-4" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-lg mt-8 sm:mt-12">
        <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide group-hover:text-brand-gold-light transition-colors">
          Perfumería Árabe de Lujo
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Las creaciones más codiciadas de Dubai y Emiratos: Lattafa, Afnan y Armaf. Acordes de oud genuino, canela, dátiles y estelas memorables.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs font-medium text-brand-gold tracking-wider uppercase group-hover:underline">
          Ver fragancias en stock →
        </span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Card 2: El Arte del Decant (1 column) -->
    <a
      href="/decants"
      class="group relative rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-brand-surface border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-gold/30 p-6 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[260px] sm:min-h-[360px] transition-all duration-300 shadow-luxury"
    >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547887537-6158d64c35b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
          alt="Decants Le Désir"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-25 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-dark via-brand-dark/70 to-transparent" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between">
        <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold font-medium">
          Decants 5ml & 10ml
        </span>
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/5 group-hover:bg-brand-gold group-hover:text-brand-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-200">
          <ArrowUpRight class="w-4 h-4" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mt-8 sm:mt-12">
        <h3 class="font-editorial text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide group-hover:text-brand-gold-light transition-colors">
          El Arte del Decanting
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
          Prueba perfumes de alta gama en tu propia piel durante semanas antes de invertir en la botella completa.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs font-medium text-brand-gold tracking-wider uppercase group-hover:underline">
          Explorar decants →
        </span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Card 3: Discovery Sets & Accesorios (Spans 3 columns) -->
    <a
      href="/catalogo?categoria=extra"
      class="group relative md:col-span-3 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-brand-surface border border-white/5 hover:border-brand-gold/30 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 transition-all duration-300 shadow-luxury"
    >
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522335789203-aabd1fc54bc9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80"
          alt="Accesorios de Perfumería"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-20 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-dark via-brand-dark/80 to-transparent" />
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-xl">
        <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-gold font-medium">
          Coffrets & Accesorios
        </span>
        <h3 class="font-editorial text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide group-hover:text-brand-gold-light transition-colors mt-1">
          Atomizadores Recargables & Discovery Sets
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-300 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">
          Atomizadores portátiles herméticos para llevar contigo y cajas curadas de 5 fragancias ideales para obsequiar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 flex-shrink-0">
        <span class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 group-hover:bg-brand-gold group-hover:text-brand-dark text-white text-xs font-medium tracking-wider uppercase border border-white/10 group-hover:border-brand-gold transition-all duration-200 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>Ver accesorios</span>
          <ArrowUpRight class="w-4 h-4" />
        </span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
